# Hero of Bladehold is cast on turn 7 and attacks alone on turn 9. Both of its abilities trigger on that one attack and
# Bot1 orders them (CR 603.3b; either order is legal, the script names it) with the Soldiers' trigger put on the stack last, so the Soldiers are made first: two 1/1 white tokens, tapped
# and attacking the player Hero is attacking (CR 508.4). Battle cry then resolves, and by that point the Soldiers are
# other attacking creatures, so they are 2/1 each — Hero, being itself, is not pumped. Bot2 takes 3 + 2 + 2.

